# NestJS 12 ships as native ESM. Jest 30 can require() ESM packages only when Node exposes
# vm.SourceTextModule, which needs --experimental-vm-modules. npm passes these options through
# NODE_OPTIONS to every script and npx invocation (npm run test:unit, npx jest src/modules/x, ...).
# Running jest outside npm requires the same NODE_OPTIONS value.
node-options=--experimental-vm-modules --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning
